---
import { REPO_URL, SITE_NAME, TAGLINE } from '../lib/site';
---

<section class="px-6 pt-10 pb-20 md:pt-14">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
    <h1 class="sr-only">{SITE_NAME}: {TAGLINE}</h1>

    <figure class="pixel-box overflow-hidden bg-white">
      <img
        src="/npc-banner.png"
        alt="Pixel art banner for NonplayerCharacter: a black dinosaur and red mushrooms on a grassy hill, under the title Non Player Character."
        width="1024"
        height="576"
        fetchpriority="high"
        class="block h-auto w-full"
      />
    </figure>

    <div class="mt-16 grid gap-14 md:grid-cols-2 md:items-center">
      <div>
        <p class="text-2xl leading-snug">
          An LLM drafts your bot once, from your business info and docs. After that, every visitor message is embedded,
          matched to the closest intent, and answered with that intent's fixed reply. No language model runs at chat time.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-5">
          <a href="/app" class="pixel-btn bg-red text-white">Build a bot</a>
          <a href={REPO_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="pixel-btn bg-white">
            View on GitHub
          </a>
          <a href="#how-it-works" class="pixel-btn bg-white">How it works</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="pixel-box bg-white p-6" aria-hidden="true">
        <p class="font-pixel text-[0.6rem] text-red">PLAYER</p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-2xl">how much does it cost?</p>

        <p class="my-5 text-center text-xl text-grass-dark">-- matched intent: Pricing --</p>

        <p class="font-pixel text-[0.6rem] text-red">NPC</p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-2xl">
          Plans start at {'{{starting_price}}'}. Want a team member to follow up?
          <span class="blink ml-1 text-red">&#9660;</span>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
